WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.700
But what can women do?

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.700
We just sit at home, in our see-through dresses,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.368
all perfumed, decked out with flowers and pretty

00:00:22.368 --> 00:00:23.300
slippers.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.000
It's all we know.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.700
It's all we need.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
What?

